        {
          "id": "nist_good_password::chunk-32",
          "content": "To sum up, if you must create a password, don’t choose “password”! And more importantly, don’t use a password alone — take advantage of other steps to secure your account, such as multifactor authentication. These additional steps are the true key for securing your account as best as possible.\n\n---",
